message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GFN & Technology Models Library (2025–2035)"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-14
authors:
  - family-names: "Pushkareva"
    given-names: "Natalya"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0688-5474"
abstract: >
  Library of four interrelated computational models of the Global Financial Network (GFN),
  cascading defaults, technology index and technological lag with focus on Russia, USA and China
  (horizon 2025–2035). Includes Monte-Carlo + Numba, Gai–Kapadia cascade, SBS twin-simulation
  and endogenous tech dynamics.
keywords:
  - agent-based modeling
  - global financial network
  - cascading defaults
  - technology index
  - technological lag
  - sanctions
  - Russia
  - computational social science
  - system dynamics
  - Monte Carlo
  - Numba
license: MIT
